OL,3,ABBC appoints Rachel Jupp as new
OL,4,Adirector of news
OL,5,
OL,6,FJupp said she was "honoured to be asked
OL,7,Fto lead BBC News", while the
OL,8,Fcorporation's director-general Matt
OL,9,FBrittin described her as "an
OL,10,Foutstanding editorial leader".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
